The parent ASPIRE source artifact contains seven Git submodule references but no
populated submodule files. A recursive checkout fetches those repositories
separately under their own terms. The pinned b1k tree includes a Pixar asset
that prohibits redistribution without written authorization; SAM 3 and cuRobo
also use custom licenses. See LICENSES/evidence/SUBMODULE_AUDIT.md before
recursively packaging or redistributing dependency content.

NVIDIA-authored YAM station assets include base_visual_gate.stl, gripper.stl,
and gripper_finger.stl. The Stereolabs ZED 2i vendor CAD is not redistributed;
ASPIRE uses an NVIDIA-authored primitive proxy and links to the official vendor
CAD only for reference.
